{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "3aa9d8209d6fcffcda29f84ca541184a9503453a22efc9925777168b562de7f8", "ja": "青空の下で", "zh": "在蔚蓝天空下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3c147884c8b3706caa6482057fc8eb8df483d2e18e960300bd7e0d769a33f765", "ja": "Cleaskyのリバイバル公演が決定！　先駆\nけて、お悩み相談形式のファンミーティング\nが開催される事に。青空の下で始まったイベ\nントだったが、美也とエレナには、悩みらし\nい悩みがない事が悩みなのだった。", "zh": "Cleasky决定举办复活公演！在此之前，\n决定先举办一场烦恼咨询形式的粉丝见面会。\n活动在蔚蓝的天空下开场，但美也和艾莲娜\n却面临着没有像样烦恼的这一烦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1000_042miy", "source_sha256": "656894b77d35c6d0631f09f1ab797207e8b7a700e15c7a22f399e8a7c2b18df5", "ja": "みなさ～ん、こんにちは～！\nCleaskyの宮尾美也です～♪", "zh": "大家好呀——！\n我是Cleasky的宫尾美也——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "8bae33b522b09b2c270b50b7ba85e7e8b0dcd9db2f8c14833ed4a11f011491b8", "ja": "みんな、元気ーっ？\nCleaskyの島原エレナだヨ！", "zh": "大家，都还好吗——？\n我是Cleasky的岛原艾琳娜哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "eceba49087d47f28d4d1ef71adb7b2762d357442b9d702db1963b9bc31119811", "ja": "今日は私たちのファンミーティングに\n集まってくれて、ありがとうございます～！", "zh": "谢谢大家今天来参加我们的粉丝见面会～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "3514b2512708651f11b30544bd5887d2e9a482c8c7645020bcc0fadf5491e108", "ja": "最後まで、いっしょに楽しもうネ♪", "zh": "大家一起开心到最后哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1004_audience", "source_sha256": "9f9404d5e94fcf78798a24d440968e5d5f0f8815f497d211f3a3fa92514c1545", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "4a3c3e4e4b76094745c8475166db43ecca2fa3e87339c5e87c1d15e782f6b6f6", "ja": "さて～。今日は、青春まっさかりのみなさんの\nお悩みを、解決していきますよ～。", "zh": "那么～今天就来为正值青春的大家解决烦恼吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "735442717e10f5187a8dd1f65af4a88d63356eaf224c31314429132aef49fe40", "ja": "事前にみんなが送ってくれたお悩みに、\nワタシたちが答えていくからネ！", "zh": "对于大家事先发来的烦恼，就由我们来一一解答哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "9057ebe72391cdcb76c0151eed37355cb99483a5b1a29b82f4d26a4a72fbc111", "ja": "期待してくださいね～。\nそれでは、気合いを入れていきましょう～。むんっ。", "zh": "请期待哦～  \n那么，打起精神来吧～。嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "bf126531ee0819e7c3672bfb7dacf4d7a9d3a13620351de0aea2fb1fdd46bd40", "ja": "あ、ねえねえ。そういえば、\nミヤは何か悩みごととかあるノ？", "zh": "啊，对了对了。说起来，米亚有什么烦恼之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "a43648b9e09a0e3a6702e2db5ff3392b0aff5bb607b99401ef51594ff70a0917", "ja": "悩みごとですか～？\nもちろん、ありますよ～。", "zh": "是烦恼吗～？\n当然有啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "04ae099e98c0c3a79d0812773a98218d1f5b382a28c88296c21a54f7b7327704", "ja": "ホント？　どんなお悩み？", "zh": "真的？是什么烦恼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "921af1d92b2e92b286843363d4e76d163af76182450a10222cc5f64858e6e8c5", "ja": "はい～。昨夜寝る前に、今日のイベントで話す、\n私の悩みのことを考えていたんです～。", "zh": "是的～我昨晚睡前一直在想，今天活动上要讲的烦恼～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "c06ead52ac7bf950a70915680ba3dc028b2dfd5c4786ac73c9fd991d9e0c0e42", "ja": "けど、途中で眠ってしまって……\n何を話そうと思っていたか、思い出せないんです～。", "zh": "可是，我在那途中睡着了……\n想不起原本打算说些什么了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "e54fa755846fe687aefc197fe44bd3b723fe06eaae1f88ce23af3637e052d686", "ja": "そっかー。……ん？\nそれって結局、悩みがないってこと？", "zh": "这样啊——……嗯？\n所以说到底，就是没有烦恼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "e356c9287c2447a9ce43a01532db4d0157265a4147b62b2ca8bb75f34b663797", "ja": "むふふ、そうかもしれませんな～。\nエレナさんには、お悩みがありますか～？", "zh": "呼呼，说不定是这样呢～。\n艾莲娜有什么烦恼吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "eca266416e4b6a8ea9b9ac53ed6d996c463f75123a19ceaf7607d961192daa40", "ja": "えっ、ワタシ！？\nえーっとネ……えーっと……。", "zh": "诶，我吗！？\n那个……嗯……购彩平台", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "d8d75036e793f1aba7e1b45bf5489e409642813cb72b968a98177a5798163c11", "ja": "エヘヘ、何か思いついたら言うネ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，要是想到什么就告诉我哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "35756b0053723bd956d02afafe283deb98c366c96ffc4815e674c583594260f9", "ja": "はい～。私も思い出したら言いますね～。", "zh": "好的～我想起来了也会告诉你的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "85c9f245fdf66fca812aabb8c63cbb538b86547118bc667f6357a5e1d4776eea", "ja": "アハハ！　ワタシたち、なんか似てるネ！\nそれじゃあ、みんなのお悩みに答えていこっ♪", "zh": "啊哈哈！我们两个，感觉还挺像的呢！\n那么，就来回答大家的烦恼吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "3c8cb190d5bdf6b6300146a0605f0272b1d2d461349df36c6301da345b16eba4", "ja": "あ、エレナさん。\nその前にこれを紹介しないといけません～。", "zh": "啊，艾丽娜。\n在那之前，得先介绍一下这个才行～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "fb2443257692b137f9aadfa8f1f7c5d52d83edc8ef97b363a126e55ab53939b1", "ja": "あっ、そうだった！\nありがと、ミヤ！　頼りになるヨ～！", "zh": "啊，对哦！\n谢谢你，美也！真是靠得住呀——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_01_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "c289558ed8e171565c91cb9e25e8682cf98733f51c379c62fb4f71ab992fff22", "ja": "ふふ、どういたしまして～。\nそれではみなさん、こちらを見てくださいね～。", "zh": "呵呵，不用客气～  \n那么大家，请看这里哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
